\fs32 \cf0 To serve massive point cloud data in a web browser using Potree and Rails 8, you'll need to pre-process your point cloud data into a streaming format, serve the static assets, and use WebGL/JavaScript in your views. [{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/potree/potree"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 1}}, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/potree/potree"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 2}}]\
