\ls7\ilvl0
\f1\b\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 EPT URL
\f0\b0 : Replace the URL above with the specific USGS EPT (Entwine Point Tile) dataset URL for your region, found directly on the USGS LiDAR Explorer Map.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Bounds
\f0\b0 : Replace the coordinates with your homeowner's property bounding box (projected to match the dataset's coordinate system).\
