\f7\fs40 \cf0 \uc0\u55357 \u56462 
\f1\b  How This Benefits the Frontend\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \cf0 Once the converted folder is saved in cloud storage, the homeowner's browser only requests the exact data points visible on their screen.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 If they look at the whole property from far away, the browser requests a tiny 
\f2\fs28 metadata.json
\f0\fs32  and low-resolution root chunks.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 As they zoom into their specific roofline, Potree dynamically makes HTTP 
\f2\fs28 GET
\f0\fs32  requests for the highly detailed sub-nodes [2].\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 This architecture guarantees 
\f1\b sub-second page load times
\f0\b0 , even if the property's dataset contains tens of millions of spatial points.\
